repository: it is true as of the last time someone re-derived it from the product, and nothing in
the build fails when it drifts. Re-derive one before repeating it, and whenever the thing it
describes changes. Regenerate this file with `caselaw upgrade`; fill its rows in
`.caselaw/answers.json` under `declarations`, not here.

